{"id":2486,"date":"2025-07-09T11:00:00","date_gmt":"2025-07-09T16:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=2486"},"modified":"2025-07-09T10:37:35","modified_gmt":"2025-07-09T15:37:35","slug":"terra-antarctica-is-absolutely-loaded","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/news\/terra-antarctica-is-absolutely-loaded\/","title":{"rendered":"Terra Antarctica is Absolutely Loaded"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p><em>EDGE Studio bring us the lowdown on<\/em> Terra Antarctica\u2026<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As the release of the premium campaign <em>Terra Antarctica <\/em>approaches, we wanted to take a minute to show you what comes in the box. Spoiler alert; it\u2019s a lot.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our first campaign box ended up being an absolute chonker; over four pounds of books, tokens, inventories, puzzles, maps, mysterious journals, cards, NPC sheets, and premade characters. Although some of our colleagues think we may have gone a bit overboard, we can absolutely promise that we did not make any deals with Cthulhu to get all this material in a single box. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Clearly, we made a pact with Yog-Sothoth instead.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-the-heart-of-the-campaign\">The Heart of the Campaign <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Our campaign is laid out in three 48-page books, each one detailing one act of the overarching story. Although we don\u2019t want to give away the plot, we can assure you that within these pages you\u2019ll find over 50 individual scenes, with room to expand the story into even more! That\u2019s at <em>least <\/em>50 hours of gameplay for you, and probably more.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-accessorizing-your-adventure\">Accessorizing Your Adventure <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>But this campaign is more than just a long and captivating adventure. We also have a ton of accessories to enhance the experience!&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/image-converter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.svc.asmodee.net%2Fproduction-arkhamhorror%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F07%2FComponents-1.jpg&amp;attachment_id=2489\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2489\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/image-converter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.svc.asmodee.net%2Fproduction-arkhamhorror%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F07%2FComponents-2.jpg&amp;attachment_id=2490\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2490\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/image-converter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.svc.asmodee.net%2Fproduction-arkhamhorror%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F07%2FComponents-3.jpg&amp;attachment_id=2491\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2491\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><em>Terra Antarctica<\/em><strong> <\/strong>has hundreds of tokens that allow you and your group to track information, determine your character\u2019s health and horror, and set out battles on our six different maps. There are also nearly 50 item cards with everything your group needs to launch an expedition into Antarctica, as well as a few of the strange things you\u2019ll find while you\u2019re there.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>But that\u2019s not all. We\u2019re also enhancing the adventure with two unique punchboard puzzles (each different, and different than any puzzles we\u2019ve done previously), crew and supply rosters from the expedition, and even a journal from a previous explorer that your group may be lucky enough to find! <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>For the first time ever, we\u2019re also including insight tokens so your group can track their insight on their character sheets. And just in case you\u2019re low on dice, we\u2019re even including an extra 24 of them in appropriately frigid colors! <\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-a-full-cast\">A Full Cast <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>But as cool as all these components are, what really makes an adventure epic are the NPCs you interact with and the adversaries you are pitted against. And<em> Terra Antarctica<\/em><strong> <\/strong>does not let you down in that department! Included in the box are 30 NPC sheets. Eleven of these are major allies that join your group for the expedition. Each of these sheets are two-sided; one side containing their profile and the other a full backstory of their character. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The other 19 sheets are double-sided with a variety of adversaries that your group will encounter. By making the sheets double-sided, we ensure that you have the right number of adversary cards for any encounter without wasted space. After all, sometimes your group ends up fighting a horde of cultists, and you need quite a few NPC sheets. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>And other times, of course, your group ends up fighting something\u2026 bigger.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/image-converter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.svc.asmodee.net%2Fproduction-arkhamhorror%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F07%2FComponents-4.jpg&amp;attachment_id=2492\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2492\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">New Investigators<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>And finally, we didn\u2019t want to provide this premium adventure without some brand new<br>investigators to play through it!\u00a0<em>Terra Antarctica<\/em>\u00a0is designed so that you can use the premade<br>investigators from\u00a0<em>Hungering Abyss<\/em>\u00a0or your own characters created with the\u00a0<em>Arkham Horror<br>Core Rulebook<\/em>. However, if neither of those options appeal to you (or maybe because you got<br>too many premade investigators from the starter set killed), we have six new investigators!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/image-converter?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.svc.asmodee.net%2Fproduction-arkhamhorror%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F07%2FComponents-5.jpg&amp;attachment_id=2493\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2493\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>All six of these characters come in four-page folios with their basic characteristics, background,<br>a cheat-sheet of common actions that they can perform during the game, and even specific<br>leveling options they can choose as the game progresses. (These premade characters are made to<br>be useable even if you don\u2019t have a copy of the\u00a0<em>Core Rulebook<\/em>.) And in addition, each<br>investigator has one bespoke knack that is unique to them and them alone.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As you can see, Winifred Habbamock is one of our intrepid investigators who has been enlisted<br>to join this expedition. Winifred will be flying the expedition\u2019s F-10 Super Trimotor airplanes,<br>which are vital for covering the vast distances of the Antarctic continent. Can you guess who the<br>other five heroic (or foolish) investigators are?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Coming in August<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p><em>Terra Antarctica<\/em>\u00a0is designed to be played with either a copy of the\u00a0<em>Hungering Abyss Starter<br>Set<\/em>\u00a0or the\u00a0<em>Arkham Horror: The Roleplaying Game Core Rulebook<\/em>. The expedition sets sail<br>this summer in August, so stay tuned to <a href=\"https:\/\/www.edge-studio.net\/\">EDGE&#8217;s website <\/a>and social media for more details.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2488,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":true},"key-tag":[37,18],"class_list":["post-2486","news","type-news","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","key-tag-edge-studio","key-tag-rpgs"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v22.3 (Yoast SEO v22.9) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Terra Antarctica is Absolutely Loaded | ArkhamHorror.com | The Official Arkham Horror Website News<\/title>\n<meta name=